From: mscharged-port contributors
Subject: [PATCH] Select original rigid character material and fixed-font fallback
Upstream-base: c7b2e663f878d38dc429ab12ee7db451daf0c217

Preserve original CharacterSkinCustom TEV/light/raster order and skin matrix
composition. Native packets emit original PNMTXIDX/position/normal/two-UV index
order through GX calls; parameter fields use native offsets and fixed widths.
Select original fixed-font atlas construction for the real missing-binding
fallback, retaining Wii glyph word byte order on native hosts. Full character,
shadow manager, software multiweight/morph and GL font startup remain separate.

